      <slug></slug>
      <title>Apache Solr and state-of-the-art search techniques</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Drupal</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Apache Solr module integrates Drupal with the Apache Solr search&#xA;platform.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Solr search can be used as a replacement for core content&#xA;search and boasts both extra features and better performance. Among&#xA;the extra features is the ability to have faceted search on facets&#xA;ranging from content author to taxonomy to arbitrary CCK fields.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
